.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK EXPORT"
.SH NAME
hamstik work export \- Export a work item as a portable Markdown document
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work export [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export a work item as a portable Markdown document
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --comments
Include the item's comments in the exported frontmatter
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B -o, --output
Write the document to a file instead of stdout
